{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ואושר בארץ</b> — that he lives many years, more than the men of his generation, and his enemies do not see their desire." "<b>ותי״ו תתנהו</b> — for a verb that is not written, like <b>אשר ילדה אותה</b>. And the meaning: the word of HaShem, or His decree. Or the vav may be in construct to the noun, and there are many such cases in Scripture."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {0 "Reading ולא יראו as 'they do not see'; alternatively the form may mean 'they do not fear.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:28.080390250Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}